        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9546> ;
    ns4:title "Labial Salivary Gland Biopsies in Sjogren'S Syndrome: Still the Gold Standard?" ;
    ns6:abstract "The accuracy and diagnostic benefits of the labial salivary gland (LSG) biopsy for Sjögren's syndrome (SS) have received mixed reviews. This study was conducted to assess (1) the inter-rater agreement among 5 pathologists, and (2) the relationship between biopsy findings and clinical disease parameters." ;
