<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1969377625> rdfs:label "Consolidative Involved-Node Proton Therapy for Stage Ia-Iiib Mediastinal Hodgkin Lymphoma: Preliminary Dosimetric Outcomes From a Phase Ii Study" ;
