        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9415994088> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2113486274> rdfs:label "Loss of Intra-Islet Cd20 Expression May Complicate Efficacy of B-Cell-Directed Type 1 Diabetes Therapies" ;
