        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n308454476>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n513739914>,
        <http://vivoweb.org/harvest/pubmedPub/pmid17245350/vivoAuthorship/l1> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2488983378> rdfs:label "Sexual Dimorphism in Development of Kidney Damage in Aging Fischer-344 Rats" ;
    ns6:abstract "Aging kidneys exhibit slowly developing injury and women are usually protected compared with men, in association with maintained renal nitric oxide." ;
