<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2864930846> rdfs:label "Effect of Allergy and Inflammation On Eicosanoid Gene Expression in Cftr Deficiency" ;
    ns6:abstract "Allergic bronchopulmonary aspergillosis (ABPA) is a complicating factor in cystic fibrosis (CF), affecting 2-15% of patients. We hypothesized that sensitization/challenge of CFTR(-/-) mice with an Aspergillus fumigatus (Af) extract will affect eicosanoid pathway gene expression, impacting ABPA and CF." ;
