<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3344142698> rdfs:label "The Effect of Blue Light Exposure in An Ocular Melanoma Animal Model" ;
    ns6:abstract "Uveal melanoma (UM) cell lines, when exposed to blue light in vitro, show a significant increase in proliferation. In order to determine if similar effects could be seen in vivo, we investigated the effect of blue light exposure in a xenograft animal model of UM." ;
