<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3500294886> rdfs:label "Comparison of Medicare Claims Versus Physician Adjudication for Identifying Stroke Outcomes in the Women's Health Initiative" ;
    ns6:abstract "Many studies use medical record review for ascertaining outcomes. One large, longitudinal study, the Women's Health Initiative (WHI), ascertains strokes using participant self-report and subsequent physician review of medical records. This is resource-intensive. Herein, we assess whether Medicare data can reliably assess stroke events in the WHI." ;
    ns6:number "3" ;
    ns6:pageStart "815" ;
    ns6:volume "45" ;
    ns3:grantCited "HHSN268201100001C",
