<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3551724818> rdfs:label "Gene Therapy of Gastric Cancer Using Light-Secreting Human Umbilical Cord Blood-Derived Mesenchymal Stem Cells" ;
    ns6:abstract "Mesenchymal stem cells (MSCs) have the ability to migrate into tumors and therefore are potential vehicles for the therapy of malignant diseases. In this study, we investigated the use of umbilical cord blood mesenchymal stem cells (UCB-MSCs) as carriers for a constant source of transgenic LIGHT (TNFSF14) to target tumor cells in vivo." ;
    ns6:pageStart "155" ;
