<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3559857744> rdfs:label "Improvement of Both Dystonia and Tics With 60 Hz Pallidal Deep Brain Stimulation" ;
    ns6:abstract "Deep brain stimulation has been utilized in both dystonia and in medication refractory Tourette syndrome. We present an interesting case of a patient with a mixture of disabling dystonia and Tourette syndrome whose coexistent dystonia and tics were successfully treated with 60 Hz-stimulation of the globus pallidus region." ;
