    ns1:pmcid "PMC2722983" .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3620538392> rdfs:label "Investigations of Antioxidant-Mediated Protection and Mitigation of Radiation-Induced Dna Damage and Lipid Peroxidation in Murine Skin" ;
    ns6:abstract "Radioprotection and mitigation effects of the antioxidants, Eukarion (EUK)-207, curcumin, and the curcumin analogs D12 and D68, on radiation-induced DNA damage or lipid peroxidation in murine skin were investigated. These antioxidants were studied because they have been previously reported to protect or mitigate against radiation-induced skin reactions." ;
