<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3665895869> rdfs:label "Anti-Argonaute2 (Ago2/Su) and -Ro Antibodies Identified By Immunoprecipitation in Primary Anti-Phospholipid Syndrome (Paps)" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1412574425>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n16586>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2318178957>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3913941915>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4912128323>,
