<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3696225696> rdfs:label "Non-Anaplastic Peripheral T-Cell Lymphoma in Childhood and Adolescence: a Children'S Oncology Group Study" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n14160>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2232963358>,
