        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n96912> ;
    ns4:title "Non-Anaplastic Peripheral T-Cell Lymphoma in Childhood and Adolescence: a Children'S Oncology Group Study" ;
    ns6:abstract "Peripheral T-cell lymphomas (PTCL) other than anaplastic large cell lymphoma (ALCL) are rare in young patients. While a high proportion of adults with PTCL have poor risk disease, pediatric PTCL is not well characterized. This study examines the outcome of localized and advanced PTCL in pediatric patients treated in standardized fashion." ;
