<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3696879648> rdfs:label "Response-Dependent and Reduced Treatment in Lower Risk Hodgkin Lymphoma in Children and Adolescents, Results of P9426: a Report From the Children's Oncology Group" ;
    ns6:abstract "Hodgkin lymphoma is highly curable but associated with significant late effects. Reduction of total treatment would be anticipated to reduce late effects. This aim of this study was to demonstrate that a reduction in treatment was possible without compromising survival outcomes." ;
