<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n41751> rdfs:label "Alemtuzumab induction in renal transplantation"^^xsd:string ;
    ns6:abstract "There are few comparisons of antibody induction therapy allowing early glucocorticoid withdrawal in renal-transplant recipients. The purpose of the present study was to compare induction therapy involving alemtuzumab with the most commonly used induction regimens in patient populations at either high immunologic risk or low immunologic risk." ;
