<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n426109791> rdfs:label "Squamous Cell Carcinoma of the External Auditory Canal Long-Term Clinical Outcomes Using Surgery and External-Beam Radiotherapy" ;
    ns6:abstract "Squamous cell carcinoma (SCCA) of the external auditory canal (EAC) is often treated with a combination of surgery and radiotherapy (RT) to optimize the chance of achieving locoregional control. This retrospective review describes a 27-year experience of treating these tumors at the University of Florida." ;
