<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n438928526> rdfs:label "Fibroblast Growth Factor-Peptide Improves Barrier Function and Proliferation in Human Keratinocytes After Radiation" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1317080268>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1370732167>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1639758746>,
