<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4429586962> rdfs:label "Caries Treatment in a Dental Practice-Based Research Network: Movement Toward Stated Evidence-Based Treatment" ;
    ns6:abstract "Practice-based research networks (PBRNs) provide a venue to foster evidence-based care. We tested the hypothesis that a higher level of participation in a dental PBRN is associated with greater stated change toward evidence-based practice." ;
