<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4663628333> rdfs:label "Minimal Impact of Sofosbuvir and Ribavirin On Health Related Quality of Life in Chronic Hepatitis C (Ch-C)" ;
    ns6:abstract "Treatment for CH-C contains interferon with substantial associated side effects and health-related quality of life (HRQL) impairment. Currently, there is no published data assessing the impact of interferon-free regimens on HRQL. The aim is to report the HRQL of patients who participated in clinical trials of sofosbuvir (SOF) for CH-C." ;
