        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9601924313> ;
    ns1:pmcid "PMC3411737" .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4987620413> rdfs:label "Evaluation of Bispectral Index (Bis) as An Indicator of Central Nervous System Depression in Horses Anesthetized With Propofol" ;
