<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5035032267> rdfs:label "Guidelines for Postdoctoral Training in Rehabilitation Psychology" ;
    ns6:abstract "This article describes the methods and results of a national conference that was held to (1) develop consensus guidelines about the structure and process of rehabilitation psychology postdoctoral training programs and (2) create a Council of Rehabilitation Psychology Postdoctoral Training Programs to promote training programs' abilities to implement the guidelines and to formally recognize programs in compliance with the guidelines." ;
