    ns4:title "Chemical Characterization of Azadirachta Indica Grafted On Melia Azedarach and Analyses of Azadirachtin By Hplc-Ms-Ms (Srm) and Meliatoxins By Maldi-Ms" ;
    ns6:abstract "Melia azedarach adapted to cool climates was selected as rootstocks for vegetative propagation of Azadirachta indica. Cleft grafting of A. indica on M. azedarach rootstock showed excellent survival. Little is known about the chemistry of grafting." ;
