<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5729274997> rdfs:label "Prevention of Ocular Scarring After Glaucoma Filtering Surgery Using the Monoclonal Antibody Lt1009 (Sonepcizumab) in a Rabbit Model" ;
    ns6:abstract "Excessive scarring leading to failure of the filtering bleb continues to be a major problem after glaucoma filtration surgery. This study examines the antifibrotic effects of the anti-S1P monoclonal antibody LT1009 (Sonepcizumab) in prolonging bleb survival in a rabbit model of glaucoma filtering surgery." ;
