<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5953453108> rdfs:label "Successful Treatment of Invasive Mucormycosis in a Liver Transplant Patient By Arm Amputation" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1110751679>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n12690>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2213065989>,
