<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6021039172> rdfs:label "Development of Autoantibodies in the Trialnet Natural History Study" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n25746>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3405560843>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4623442613>,
