<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6369352611> rdfs:label "Neuroprotection By Donepezil Against Glutamate Excitotoxicity Involves Stimulation of Alpha 7 Nicotinic Receptors and Internalization of Nmda Receptors" ;
