<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6425163006> rdfs:label "Phylodynamics and Molecular Evolution of Influenza a Virus Nucleoprotein Genes in Taiwan Between 1979 and 2009" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n147269777>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1636390888>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3018246910>,
