<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7132404624> rdfs:label "Total and Abdominal Adiposity Are Associated With Inflammation in Older Adults Using a Factor Analysis Approach" ;
    ns6:abstract "Obesity-related increases in multiple inflammatory markers may contribute to the persistent subclinical inflammation common with advancing age. However, it is unclear if a specific combination of markers reflects the underlying inflammatory state. We used factor analysis to identify inflammatory factor(s) and examine their associations with adiposity in older adults at risk for disability." ;
