<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7360824928> rdfs:label "Carbon Monoxide and Nitric Oxide Mediate Cytoskeletal Reorganization in Microvascular Cells Via Vasodilator-Stimulated Phosphoprotein Phosphorylation - Evidence for Blunted Responsiveness in Diabetes" ;
