<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7493958978> rdfs:label "Reduction of Catheter-Associated Urinary Tract Infections Among Patients in a Neurological Intensive Care Unit: a Single Institution'S Success" ;
    ns6:abstract "To date, there has been a shortage of evidence-based quality improvement initiatives that have shown positive outcomes in the neurosurgical patient population. A single-institution prospective intervention trial with continuous feedback was conducted to investigate the implementation of a urinary tract infection (UTI) prevention bundle to decrease the catheter-associated UTI rate." ;
