        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9464528454> ;
    ns1:pmcid "PMC3608791" .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7651568948> rdfs:label "Endoscopic Swept-Source Optical Coherence Tomography Based On a Two-Axis Microelectromechanical System Mirror" ;
    ns6:abstract "A microelectromechanical system (MEMS) mirror based endoscopic swept-source optical coherence tomography (SS-OCT) system that can perform three-dimensional (3-D) imaging at high speed is reported. The key component enabling 3-D endoscopic imaging is a two-axis MEMS scanning mirror which has a 0.8×0.8  mm2 mirror plate and a 1.6×1.4  mm2 device footprint. The diameter of the endoscopic probe is only 3.5 mm. The imaging rate of the SS-OCT system is 50  frames/s. OCT images of both human suspicious oral leukoplakia tissue and normal buccal mucosa were taken in vivo and compared. The OCT imaging result agrees well with the histopathological analysis." ;
    ns6:volume "18" ;
    ns3:harvestedBy "Python Pubs version 1.1" ;
