    ns4:title "Natural History of Small Duct Primary Sclerosing Cholangitis: a Case Series With Review of the Literature" ;
    ns6:abstract "Information about the natural history of small duct primary sclerosing cholangitis (SDPSC) remains scant despite literature suggesting that it constitutes 6-16% of all cases of primary sclerosing cholangitis (PSC). We combined clinical data on SDPSC cases from two tertiary care institutions with liver transplantation programs with the aim of studying the natural history of SDPSC." ;
