<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n795228953> rdfs:label "Peripheral Myelin Protein-22 (Pmp22) Modulates Alpha 6 Integrin Expression in the Human Endometrium" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1355435659>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n20688>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2390700582>,
