        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6841542642>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7344948098> ;
    ns4:title "Peripheral Myelin Protein-22 (Pmp22) Modulates Alpha 6 Integrin Expression in the Human Endometrium" ;
    ns6:abstract "PMP22, a member of the GAS3 family of tetraspan proteins, is associated with a variety of neurological diseases. Previous studies have shown that PMP22 is expressed in proliferative endometrium, but its function within this tissue is poorly understood. In this study, we first characterized the expression of PMP22 in the human menstrual cycle and began to characterize its function in the endometrium." ;
