<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8203981176> rdfs:label "Protective Effect of Kcnh2 Single Nucleotide Polymorphism K897T in Lqts Families and Identification of Novel Kcnq1 and Kcnh2 Mutations" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1124904560>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2108730051>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2172260034>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2236116932>,
