    ns4:title "Preventing Eye Injuries Among Citrus Harvesters: the Community Health Worker Model" ;
    ns6:abstract "Although eye injuries are common among citrus harvesters, the proportion of workers using protective eyewear has been negligible. We focused on adoption of worker-tested safety glasses with and without the presence and activities of trained peer-worker role models on harvesting crews." ;
