<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8705585866> rdfs:label "Tilling for Allergen Reduction and Improvement of Quality Traits in Peanut (Arachis Hypogaea L.)" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n262281182>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n35010>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5591464716>,
