<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8883440742> rdfs:label "Association of Beta(1)-Adrenergic Receptor Genetic Polymorphism With Mental Stress-Induced Myocardial Ischemia in Patients With Coronary Artery Disease" ;
