<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n910963815> rdfs:label "Platelet Reactivity and Cardiovascular Outcomes After Percutaneous Coronary Intervention a Time-Dependent Analysis of the Gauging Responsiveness With a Verifynow P2Y12 Assay: Impact On Thrombosis and Safety (Gravitas) Trial" ;
