<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9133808219> rdfs:label "Pharmacodynamics of Early, High-Dose Linezolid Against Vancomycin-Resistant Enterococci With Elevated Mics and Pre-Existing Genetic Mutations" ;
    ns6:abstract "Vancomycin-resistant enterococci (VRE) have emerged as an important nosocomial pathogen in medical centres worldwide. This study evaluated the impact of front-loading of linezolid on bacterial killing and suppression of resistance against VRE strains with defined genetic mutations." ;
