    ns4:title "The Fungicide Chlorothalonil Is Nonlinearly Associated With Corticosterone Levels, Immunity, and Mortality in Amphibians" ;
    ns6:abstract "Contaminants have been implicated in declines of amphibians, a taxon with vital systems similar to those of humans. However, many chemicals have not been thoroughly tested on amphibians or do not directly kill them." ;
