<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9687610014> rdfs:label "Adolescent Transition To Adult Care in Solid Organ Transplantation: a Consensus Conference Report" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n14442>,
