        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9277965226>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9524063183>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9661281856> ;
    ns1:pmcid "PMC3607873" .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9724801262> rdfs:label "African American Adult Apheresis Donors Respond To Granulocyte-Colony-Stimulating Factor With Neutrophil and Progenitor Cell Yields Comparable To Those of Caucasian and Hispanic Donors" ;
