        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8524646201>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9684808267> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9823813804> rdfs:label "Sex Differences in Asthma Symptom Profiles and Control in the American Lung Association Asthma Clinical Research Centers" ;
    ns6:abstract "Important differences between men and women with asthma have been demonstrated, with women describing more symptoms and worse asthma-related quality of life (QOL) despite having similar or better pulmonary function. While current guidelines focus heavily on assessing asthma control, they lack information about whether sex-specific approaches to asthma assessment should be considered. We sought to determine if sex differences in asthma control or symptom profiles exist in the well-characterized population of participants in the American Lung Association Asthma Clinical Research Centers (ALA-ACRC) trials." ;
    ns6:pageStart "1491" ;
