<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9930746873> rdfs:label "Substrate Metabolism During Basal and Hyperinsulinemic Conditions in Adolescents and Young-Adults With Barth Syndrome" ;
    ns6:abstract "Barth syndrome (BTHS) is a rare X-linked disorder that is characterized by mitochondrial abnormalities, infantile or childhood onset of cardioskeletal myopathy, and high mortality rates. It is currently unknown if BTHS related mitochondrial dysfunction results in substrate metabolism abnormalities and thereby contributes to cardioskeletal myopathy in patients with BTHS." ;
