        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9183967721> ;
    ns1:pmcid "PMC3781481" .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9964559916> rdfs:label "Proteolytic Processing of Connective Tissue Growth Factor in Normal Ocular Tissues and During Corneal Wound Healing" ;
    ns6:abstract "Connective tissue growth factor (CTGF) is a fibrogenic cytokine that is up-regulated by TGF-β and mediates most key fibrotic actions of TGF-β, including stimulation of synthesis of extracellular matrix and differentiation of fibroblasts into myofibroblasts. This study addresses the role of proteolytic processing of CTGF in human corneal fibroblasts (HCF) stimulated with TGF-β, normal ocular tissues and wounded corneas." ;
