<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1609860732> rdfs:label "Differential Reactivity To Impdh2 By Anti-Rods/Rings Autoantibodies and Unresponsiveness To Pegylated Interferon-Alpha/Ribavirin Therapy in Us and Italian Hcv Patients" ;
