<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1706363420> rdfs:label "A Multi-Institutional Experience of Repeat Regional Chemotherapy for Recurrent Melanoma of Extremities" ;
    ns6:abstract "Hyperthermic isolated limb perfusion (HILP) or isolated limb infusion (ILI) are well-accepted regional chemotherapy techniques for in-transit melanoma of extremity. The role and efficacy of repeat regional chemotherapy for recurrence and which salvage procedure is better remains debatable. We aimed to compare toxicities and clinical outcomes by procedure types and the sequence." ;
