<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1959848844> rdfs:label "Gold-Speckled Multimodal Nanoparticles for Noninvasive Bioimaging" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n11287>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n11314>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n17962>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n26143>,
