<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2150654932> rdfs:label "Cd62L as a Therapeutic Target in Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia" ;
    ns6:abstract "Despite advances in the treatment of chronic lymphocytic leukemia (CLL), the disease remains incurable with standard therapies and relapse is inevitable. A growing body of evidence indicates that alterations in the adhesion properties of neoplastic cells play a pivotal role in the development and progression of CLL." ;
