<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2491358056> rdfs:label "Experimental and Computational Studies of the Homogeneous Thermal Decomposition of the Tungsten Dimethylhydrazido Complexes Cl-4(Rcn)W(Nnme2)" ;
