    ns4:title "Factors Related To Extended Hospital Stays Following Deep Brain Stimulation for Parkinson's Disease" ;
    ns6:abstract "Patients with Parkinson's disease (PD) are typically discharged from the hospital the day following deep brain stimulation (DBS) surgery; however, factors extending hospital stay are largely unknown. This study examined potential factors that might have corresponded to increased post-operative stays following unilateral DBS surgery." ;
