<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2853224101> rdfs:label "Influence of Genetic Polymorphisms On the Effect of High-and Standard-Dose Clopidogrel After Percutaneous Coronary Intervention the Gift (Genotype Information and Functional Testing) Study" ;
