<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2914824828> rdfs:label "Disturbed Small-World Networks and Neurocognitive Function in Frontal Lobe Low-Grade Glioma Patients" ;
    ns6:abstract "Brain tumor patients often associated with losses of the small-world configuration and neurocognitive functions before operations. However, few studies were performed on the impairments of frontal lobe low-grade gliomas (LGG) after tumor resection using small-world network features." ;
