<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3003316178> rdfs:label "Diagnostic Accuracy of Quantitative Cardiac Mri Evaluation Compared To Stress Single-Photon-Emission Computed Tomography" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n26191>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n28486>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4714435574>,
