<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n306372941> rdfs:label "Development of a Simulation Environment To Study Emergency Department Information Technology" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1575084043>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1734860299>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n320431016>,
