        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9755117273> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n339321088> rdfs:label "Myeloperoxidase levels and mortality in frail community-living elderly individuals." ;
    ns6:abstract "Elevated systemic levels of myeloperoxidase (MPO) have been associated with unfavourable clinical outcomes. In the present study, we evaluate the impact of MPO, a pro-oxidant enzyme that catalyzes the initiation of lipid peroxidation and affects nitric oxide levels, on the risk of all-cause mortality in a large population of frail octogenarians and nonagenarians living in community." ;
    ns6:number "4" ;
    ns6:volume "65" ;
