        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8969131406>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9104422552> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3800731047> rdfs:label "Progressive Erosion of Beta-Cell Function Precedes the Onset of Hyperglycemia in the Nod Mouse Model of Type 1 Diabetes" ;
