    ns4:title "Almost Internists: Analysis of Students Who Considered Internal Medicine But Chose Other Fields" ;
    ns6:abstract "Medical students' career choices affect health care. To understand how to increase the number of students who choose careers in internal medicine (IM), students who seriously considered IM but chose another field (\"Switchers\") and those who rejected IM (\"Never Considered\") were compared with those who chose IM (\"Choosers\")." ;
