<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4209354704> rdfs:label "Surgical Outcomes for Moyamoya Angiopathy At Barrow Neurological Institute With Comparison of Adult Indirect Encephaloduroarteriosynangiosis Bypass, Adult Direct Superficial Temporal Artery-To-Middle Cerebral Artery Bypass, and Pediatric Bypass: 154 Revascularization Surgeries in 140 Affected Hemispheres" ;
