<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4981103591> rdfs:label "Interferon-Gamma Induces Progressive Nigrostriatal Degeneration and Basal Ganglia Calcification" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1078768361>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1162204259>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n129>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1665717470>,
