<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5038583559> rdfs:label "Prognostic Implications of Early and Long-Term Bleeding Events in Patients On One-Year Dual Antiplatelet Therapy Following Drug-Eluting Stent Implantation" ;
    ns6:abstract "Bleeding has emerged as a predictor of early and late mortality after percutaneous coronary interventions. However, the prevalence and predictors of long-term bleeding events in patients on prolonged dual antiplatelet therapy (DAPT) after drug-eluting stent (DES) implantation has been poorly explored." ;
