    ns4:title "Sleep-Disordered Breathing and Urinary Albumin Excretion in Older Men" ;
    ns6:abstract "Sleep-disordered breathing (SDB) may be deleterious to the cardiovascular system and other organs, including the kidney. Although older men are at increased risk for both kidney disease and SDB, it is unknown whether SDB is associated with higher urinary albumin excretion in this population." ;
