        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8136092290>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n850349721>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n978306522> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6060404828> rdfs:label "A Regionalised Strategy for Improving Motor Vehicle-Related Highway Driver Deaths Using a Weighted Averages Method" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n125371>,
