<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7604346660> rdfs:label "Clock Drawing in the Montreal Cognitive Assessment: Recommendations for Dementia Assessment" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2156557974>,
