        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7744245904> ;
    ns4:title "Clock Drawing in the Montreal Cognitive Assessment: Recommendations for Dementia Assessment" ;
    ns6:abstract "Clock drawing is part of the Montreal Cognitive Assessment (MoCA) test but may have administration and scoring limitations. We assessed (1) the reliability of the MoCA clock criteria relative to a published error scoring approach, (2) whether command-only administration could distinguish dementia from cognitively intact individuals and (3) the value of adding a clock copy condition to the MoCA." ;
