        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9693671227> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8026254590> rdfs:label "Hip Fractures and Pain Following Proton Therapy for Management of Prostate Cancer" ;
    ns6:abstract "Proton therapy (PT) for prostate cancer reduces rectal and bladder dose, but increases dose to the femoral necks. We assessed the risk of hip fracture and pain in men treated with PT for prostate cancer." ;
    ns6:pageStart "486" ;
    ns6:volume "52" ;
