<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9010820453> rdfs:label "Baseline Spatial Distribution of Malaria Prior To An Elimination Programme in Vanuatu" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n16811>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2894668095>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5688468191>,
