<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9602928444> rdfs:label "Autoantibodies To Survival of Motor Neuron Complex in Patients With Polymyositis: Immunoprecipitation of D, E, F, and G Proteins Without Other Components of Small Nuclear Ribonucleoproteins" ;
