        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8143135917>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n980129189> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9684190794> rdfs:label "Marker Rescue Mapping of the Combined Condit/Dales Collection of Temperature-Sensitive Vaccinia Virus Mutants" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1036>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1432357517>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n16105>,
