<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1218414418> rdfs:label "Mthfr 677C -> T Genotype Is Associated With Folate and Homocysteine Concentrations in a Large, Population-Based, Double-Blind Trial of Folic Acid Supplementation" ;
