<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1257566779> rdfs:label "Prevention of Hpv-Related Oral Cancer: Assessing Dentists' Readiness" ;
    ns6:abstract "Epidemiological research indicates an association between the Human Papillomavirus (HPV) with a subset of oral cancers (OC). Dentists may play a role in primary prevention of HPV-related OC by discussing the HPV vaccine with patients. This study assessed dentists' readiness to discuss the HPV vaccine with female patients." ;
