    ns4:title "Adjusted Indirect Comparison Meta-Analysis of Prasugrel Versus Ticagrelor for Patients With Acute Coronary Syndromes" ;
    ns6:abstract "Clopidogrel is beneficial after ACS. Recent data suggest the superiority of prasugrel or ticagrelor compared with clopidogrel. However, there is no comparison of prasugrel vs. ticagrelor. We performed an adjusted indirect meta-analysis comparing prasugrel vs. ticagrelor for acute coronary syndromes (ACSs)." ;
