<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2010080397> rdfs:label "Similarity Analysis, Synthesis, and Bioassay of Antibacterial Cyclic Peptidomimetics" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n116751>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1373001488>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n20422>,
