        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9874784487> ;
    ns4:title "Long-Term Survival and Late Deaths After Allogeneic Hematopoietic Cell Transplantation" ;
    ns6:abstract "Allogeneic hematopoietic cell transplantation (HCT) is curative but is associated with life-threatening complications. Most deaths occur within the first 2 years after transplantation. In this report, we examine long-term survival in 2-year survivors in the largest cohort ever studied." ;
