<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2306244514> rdfs:label "Dimensional Predictors of Response To Sri Pharmacotherapy in Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder" ;
    ns6:abstract "Obsessive-compulsive disorder (OCD) is clinically heterogeneous. Previous studies have reported different patterns of treatment response to serotonin reuptake inhibitors (SRI) based on symptom dimension. Our objective was to replicate these results in OCD patients who participated in one of four randomized, placebo-controlled, clinical trials (RCT)." ;
