<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2736686097> rdfs:label "Characteristics of Thawed Autologous Umbilical Cord Blood" ;
    ns6:abstract "Autologous umbilical cord blood (AutoUCB) has historically been cryopreserved for potential use in hematopoietic transplantation. Increasingly, private AutoUCB banking is performed for therapies unavailable today. A Phase I trial using AutoUCB treatment for early pediatric Type 1 diabetes afforded us an opportunity to analyze characteristics of AutoUCBs." ;
    ns6:pageStart "2234" ;
    ns6:volume "52" ;
