<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2829583938> rdfs:label "The Utility of Nodule Volume in the Context of Malignancy Prediction for Small Pulmonary Nodules" ;
    ns6:abstract "An estimated 150,000 pulmonary nodules are identified each year, and the number is likely to increase given the results of the National Lung Screening Trial. Decision tools are needed to help with the management of such pulmonary nodules. We examined whether adding any of three novel functions of nodule volume improves the accuracy of an existing malignancy prediction model of CT scan-detected nodules." ;
