    ns4:title "Diminishing Role of Contrast Enema in Simple Meconium Ileus" ;
    ns6:abstract "Contrast enema is the initial study of choice for simple meconium ileus to confirm diagnosis and to relieve obstruction. Despite favorable historically published results, our clinical impression suggests decreased effectiveness of the contrast enema resulting in more surgical interventions in contemporary practice." ;
