<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3728901419> rdfs:label "Demographic and Health Factors Associated With Enrollment in Posttrial Studies: the Women's Health Initiative Hormone Therapy Trials" ;
    ns6:abstract "After clinical trials end, continued follow-up of the assembled cohort often is desirable for additional research. Factors influencing participants' decisions to consent to additional follow-up and how these shape posttrial cohorts have not been broadly studied." ;
