        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9985896577> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3896852810> rdfs:label "Next-Generation Sequencing and Genome Evolution in Allopolyploids" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1264428428>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1413374933>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n14765>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n16275>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1761806583>,
