<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4170648693> rdfs:label "Disentangling Stand and Environmental Correlates of Aboveground Biomass in Amazonian Forests" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1022827861>,
