<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4757839385> rdfs:label "The Excite Stroke Trial Comparing Early and Delayed Constraint-Induced Movement Therapy" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n111006441>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2603664100>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3267496240>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3672163904>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4581924884>,
