<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5422855383> rdfs:label "Use of a Vascular Reconstruction Device To Salvage Acute Ischemic Occlusions Refractory To Traditional Endovascular Recanalization Methods" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3292>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3576442702>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3577737965>,
