<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5599848334> rdfs:label "Equine Deep Stromal Abscesses (51 Cases - 2004-2009) - Part 2: the Histopathology and Immunohistochemical Aspect With Attention To the Histopathologic Diagnosis, Vascular Response, and Infectious Agents" ;
