<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7396479124> rdfs:label "Adjuvant Interferon-Based Chemoradiation Followed By Gemcitabine for Resected Pancreatic Adenocarcinoma: a Single-Lnstitution Phase Ii Study" ;
