<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7429784705> rdfs:label "Combined Reduced Forced Expiratory Volume in 1 Second (Fev1) and Peripheral Artery Disease in Sedentary Elders With Functional Limitations" ;
    ns6:abstract "Because they are potentially modifiable and may coexist, we evaluated the combined occurrence of a reduced forced expiratory volume in 1 second (FEV1) and peripheral artery disease (PAD), including its association with exertional symptoms, physical inactivity, and impaired mobility, in sedentary elders with functional limitations." ;
