<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8002956367> rdfs:label "Fugl-Meyer Assessment of Sensorimotor Function After Stroke Standardized Training Procedure for Clinical Practice and Clinical Trials" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n20335>,
