<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8132782027> rdfs:label "E2A-Znf384 and Nol1-E2a Fusion Created By a Cryptic T(12;19)(P13.3; P13.3) in Acute Leukemia" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2691>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3855096011>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4349278947>,
