<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8325199256> rdfs:label "Assessment of Potential Relationship Between Wall Shear Stress and Arterial Wall Response After Bare Metal Stent and Sirolimus-Eluting Stent Implantation in Patients With Diabetes Mellitus" ;
