<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8396713843> rdfs:label "Post-Cardiac Transplant Survival After Support With a Continuous-Flow Left Ventricular Assist Device: Impact of Duration of Left Ventricular Assist Device Support and Other Variables" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n123761>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2042720496>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2165935425>,
