        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5068683886>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5441762060>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6828669182>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6868996015> ;
    ns4:title "Diphenhydramine Dose-Response: a Novel Approach To Determine Triage Thresholds" ;
    ns6:abstract "It is unclear how much diphenhydramine (DPH) is toxic in humans. Previous dose-response studies have had conflicting results. Objective. We sought to evaluate DPH dose-response using a unique method that utilizes acetaminophen (APAP) serum concentrations to estimate DPH doses in patients ingesting APAP/DPH in a fixed-combination product." ;
