<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1345092603> rdfs:label "Synthesis and Biological Evaluation of 2-Amino-3-(4-Chlorobenzoyl)-4-{[}N-(Substituted) Piperazin-1-Yl]Thiophenes as Potent Allosteric Enhancers of the A(1) Adenosine Receptor" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1360982>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2154809689>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2306728370>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2414339501>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2808255074>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3588164782>,
