<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1963723778> rdfs:label "Impact of inflammation on the relationship among alcohol consumption, mortality, and cardiac events: the health, aging, and body composition study." ;
    ns6:abstract "Uncertainty remains about the overall survival benefit of alcohol consumption and the mechanisms underlying the cardioprotective effect of light to moderate alcohol intake. Recent evidence suggests an anti-inflammatory effect of light to moderate alcohol consumption. We investigated the relationship of alcohol intake with all-cause mortality and cardiac events and evaluated whether this relationship is mediated or modified by inflammatory markers." ;
    ns6:number "14" ;
    ns6:volume "166" ;
