<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2693004289> rdfs:label "Prophylactic Nesiritide Does Not Prevent Dialysis Or All-Cause Mortality in Patients Undergoing High-Risk Cardiac Surgery" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n107737>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n123761>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n12435>,
