        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9230841132>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9621733652> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3234396024> rdfs:label "Interaction Between the Ucp2-866 G > a Polymorphism, Diabetes, and Beta-Blocker Use Among Patients With Acute Coronary Syndromes" ;
