<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3411359375> rdfs:label "Haplotype-Based Study of the Association of Alcohol-Metabolizing Genes With Alcohol Dependence in Four Independent Populations" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n10202>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1984464564>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2964639952>,
