        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9496959459> ;
    ns4:title "Ab-Externo Aav-Mediated Gene Delivery To the Suprachoroidal Space Using a 250 Micron Flexible Microcatheter" ;
    ns6:abstract "The current method of delivering gene replacement to the posterior segment of the eye involves a three-port pars plana vitrectomy followed by injection of the agent through a 37-gauge cannula, which is potentially wrought with retinal complications. In this paper we investigate the safety and efficacy of delivering adeno-associated viral (AAV) vector to the suprachoroidal space using an ab externo approach that utilizes an illuminated microcatheter." ;
