<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4088635923> rdfs:label "Semiquantitative Mibg Scoring as a Prognostic Indicator in Patients With Stage 4 Neuroblastoma: a Report From the Children's Oncology Group" ;
    ns6:abstract "Radiolabeled metaiodobenzylguanidine (mIBG) is a highly sensitive and specific marker for detecting neuroblastoma. A semiquantitative mIBG score (Curie score [CS]) was assessed for utility as a prognostic indicator for a cohort of patients with high-risk metastatic disease." ;
