<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5632384774> rdfs:label "Prognostic Value of Virological and Immunological Responses After 6 Months of Antiretroviral Treatment in Adults With Hiv-1 Infection in Sub-Saharan Africa" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n170941733>,
