<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5841343193> rdfs:label "Placental Transfer of Anti-Tumor Necrosis Factor Agents in Pregnant Patients With Inflammatory Bowel Disease" ;
    ns6:abstract "Some women with inflammatory bowel disease require therapy with tumor necrosis factor (TNF) antagonists during pregnancy. It is not clear whether these drugs are transferred to the fetus via the placenta and then cleared, or whether structurally different TNF antagonists have different rates of transfer." ;
