<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8233601524> rdfs:label "Comorbid Depression and Anxiety Symptoms as Predictors of Cardiovascular Events: Results From the Nhlbi-Sponsored Women's Ischemia Syndrome Evaluation (Wise) Study" ;
