        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n96912> ;
    ns4:title "Autologous Umbilical Cord Blood Transfusion in Young Children With Type 1 Diabetes Fails To Preserve C-Peptide" ;
    ns6:abstract "We conducted an open-label, phase I study using autologous umbilical cord blood (UCB) infusion to ameliorate type 1 diabetes (T1D). Having previously reported on the first 15 patients reaching 1 year of follow-up, herein we report on the complete cohort after 2 years of follow-up." ;
