<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8688110537> rdfs:label "Dhea-S Levels and Cardiovascular Disease Mortality in Postmenopausal Women: Results From the National Institutes of Health-National Heart, Lung, and Blood Institute (Nhlbi)-Sponsored Women's Ischemia Syndrome Evaluation (Wise)" ;
