<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8777377358> rdfs:label "Stress Management Effects On Perceived Stress and Cervical Neoplasia in Low-Income Hiv-Infected Women" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1072957678>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1545615098>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1853880999>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2678704517>,
