<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8836079717> rdfs:label "Reduced Serum Vitamin D-Binding Protein Levels Are Associated With Type 1 Diabetes" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n14185>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1888403270>,
