        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8453537446>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9639156213> .

<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n94367989> rdfs:label "Phytoestrogens and coronary microvascular function in women with suspected myocardial ischemia: a report from the Women's Ischemia Syndrome Evaluation (WISE) Study." ;
    ns6:abstract "Soy phytoestrogens are popular, but information on their coronary effects in patients with suspected ischemic heart disease is limited. Accordingly, we investigated the relationship between blood phytoestrogen levels and coronary reactivity in women with suspected myocardial ischemia referred for coronary angiography." ;
