<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9993643926> rdfs:label "A Randomized Study Assessing the Impact of Cilostazol On Platelet Function Profiles in Patients With Diabetes Mellitus and Coronary Artery Disease On Dual Antiplatelet Therapy: Results of the Optimus-2 Study" ;
