<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2324051214> rdfs:label "The Art of Bedside Rounds: a Multi-Center Qualitative Study of Strategies Used By Experienced Bedside Teachers" ;
    ns6:abstract "Medical educators believe bedside rounds are effective for the delivery of patient-centered care, and are necessary in helping trainees acquire competence in clinical care. Although recommendations for bedside rounds have been reported, a recent, systematic assessment of strategies used by current-day bedside teachers was needed to advance knowledge of this teaching method." ;
