<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2966894845> rdfs:label "An Intravascular Ultrasound Analysis in Women Experiencing Chest Pain in the Absence of Obstructive Coronary Artery Disease: a Substudy From the National Heart, Lung and Blood Institute-Sponsored Women's Ischemia Syndrome Evaluation (Wise)" ;
