<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n525161749> rdfs:label "The Joint Impact of Smoking and Exercise Capacity On Clinical Outcomes Among Women With Suspected Myocardial Ischemia: the Wise Study" ;
    ns6:abstract "Although extensive research has been conducted on both smoking and low exercise capacity alone, few studies have examined the joint impact or interaction of these two risk factors. We examined the joint and interactive effects of smoking and self-reported exercise capacity on subsequent clinical events (heart failure, myocardial infarction [MI], stroke, and cardiovascular-related mortality) among women with suspected myocardial ischemia." ;
    ns6:pageStart "443" ;
    ns6:volume "18" ;
