<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5441606126> rdfs:label "Prospective Study of Avian Influenza Virus Infections Among Rural Thai Villagers" ;
    ns6:abstract "In 2008, 800 rural Thai adults living within Kamphaeng Phet Province were enrolled in a prospective cohort study of zoonotic influenza transmission. Serological analyses of enrollment sera suggested this cohort had experienced subclinical avian influenza virus (AIV) infections with H9N2 and H5N1 viruses." ;
