<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5501251635> rdfs:label "Health Impact of Us Military Service in a Large Population-Based Military Cohort: Findings of the Millennium Cohort Study, 2001-2008" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1132411864>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1792185064>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2244858726>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2343878736>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2514384472>,
