<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n556074307> rdfs:label "The Adverse Impact of Type 2 Diabetes On Brain Volume in Heart Failure" ;
    ns6:abstract "Heart failure (HF) is associated with structural brain abnormalities, including atrophy in multiple brain regions. Type 2 diabetes mellitus (T2DM) is a prevalent comorbid condition in HF and is associated with abnormalities on neuroimaging in other medical and elderly samples. The current study examined whether comorbid T2DM exacerbates brain atrophy in older adults with HF." ;
    ns6:pageStart "309" ;
    ns6:volume "35" ;
    ns3:grantCited "DK075119",
