<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5674118475> rdfs:label "Multimodality Imaging of Beta-Cells in Mouse Models of Type 1 and 2 Diabetes" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1285635178>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1549420250>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2018763763>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2243333601>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n321744402>,
