<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5721211615> rdfs:label "Identifying and Overcoming the Barriers To Bedside Rounds: a Multicenter Qualitative Study" ;
    ns6:abstract "The use of bedside rounds in teaching hospitals has declined, despite recommendations from educational leaders to promote this effective teaching strategy. The authors sought to identify reasons for the decrease in bedside rounds, actual barriers to bedside rounds, methods to overcome trainee apprehensions, and proposed strategies to educate faculty." ;
