<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n574687831> rdfs:label "A Randomized Controlled, Phase 2 Trial of the Viral Serpin Serp-1 in Patients With Acute Coronary Syndromes Undergoing Percutaneous Coronary Intervention" ;
