<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6691988575> rdfs:label "A Randomized Controlled Trial of Low-Dose Hormone Therapy On Myocardial Ischemia in Postmenopausal Women With No Obstructive Coronary Artery Disease: Results From the National Institutes of Health/National Heart, Lung, and Blood Institute-Sponsored Women's Ischemia Syndrome Evaluation (Wise)" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1193162507>,
