<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7662091381> rdfs:label "Ticagrelor Vs. Clopidogrel in Patients With Acute Coronary Syndromes and Diabetes: a Substudy From the Platelet Inhibition and Patient Outcomes (Plato) Trial" ;
