<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7947476943> rdfs:label "Subjective Perception of Cognition Is Related To Mood and Not Performance" ;
    ns6:abstract "Clinicians monitor cognitive effects of drugs primarily by asking patients to describe their side effects. We examined the relationship of subjective perception of cognition to mood and objective cognitive performance in healthy volunteers and neurological patients." ;
