    ns4:title "Contrast-Enhanced Mr Imaging of Brain Lesions: a Large-Scale Intraindividual Crossover Comparison of Gadobenate Dimeglumine Versus Gadodiamide" ;
    ns6:abstract "The higher relaxivity of gadobenate dimeglumine compared with gadodiamide is potentially advantageous for contrast-enhanced brain MR imaging. This study intraindividually compared 0.1-mmol/kg doses of these agents for qualitative and quantitative lesion enhancement." ;
