<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n82088> rdfs:label "Patient Resources Available to Bladder Cancer Patients: A Pilot Study of Healthcare Providers"^^xsd:string ;
    ns6:abstract "To survey thought leaders attending an annual bladder cancer conference about resources available to survivors at, primarily, large academic centers treating a high volume of patients. Bladder cancer is a disease with high treatment burden. Support groups and survivorship programs are effective at managing physical and psychosocial impairments experienced by patients. The Institute of Medicine recommends increased resources for cancer survivorship, but no description of current resources exists for bladder cancer patients." ;
