<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8903210821> rdfs:label "A World Malaria Map: Plasmodium Falciparum Endemicity in 2007" ;
    ns6:abstract "Efficient allocation of resources to intervene against malaria requires a detailed understanding of the contemporary spatial distribution of malaria risk. It is exactly 40 y since the last global map of malaria endemicity was published. This paper describes the generation of a new world map of Plasmodium falciparum malaria endemicity for the year 2007." ;
    ns6:volume "6" ;
    ns3:grantCited "079080",
