<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n892247547> rdfs:label "The Sts Avr Plus Cabg Composite Score: a Report of the Sts Quality Measurement Task Force" ;
    ns6:abstract "The Society of Thoracic Surgeons (STS) is developing a portfolio of composite performance measures for the most commonly performed adult cardiac procedures. This manuscript describes the third composite measure in this series, aortic valve replacement (AVR) combined with coronary artery bypass grafting surgery (CABG)." ;
