<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9648173824> rdfs:label "Limited Value of Plasma Cytokeratin-18 as a Biomarker for Nash and Fibrosis in Patients With Non-Alcoholic Fatty Liver Disease" ;
    ns6:abstract "Liver biopsy is the only reliable way of diagnosing and staging NASH but its invasive nature limits its use. Plasma caspase-generated cytokeratin-18 fragments (CK-18) have been proposed as a non-invasive alternative. We studied its clinical value in a large multiethnic NAFLD population and examined its relationship to clinical/metabolic/histological parameters." ;
    ns6:number "1" ;
    ns6:pageStart "167" ;
