<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9669463441> rdfs:label "Growth Failure and Outcome in Rett Syndrome Specific Growth References" ;
    ns6:abstract "Prominent growth failure typifies Rett syndrome (RTT). Our aims were to 1) develop RTT growth charts for clinical and research settings, 2) compare growth in children with RTT with that of unaffected children, and 3) compare growth patterns among RTT genotypes and phenotypes." ;
