    ns4:title "Decline in Rejection in the First Year After Pediatric Cardiac Transplantation: a Multi-Institutional Study" ;
    ns6:abstract "Rejection is a major cause of morbidity and mortality after pediatric heart transplantation (HTx). Survival after pediatric HTx has improved over time, but whether there has been an era-related improvement in the occurrence of allograft rejection is unknown." ;
