<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2395579399> rdfs:label "Total Estrogen Time and Obstructive Coronary Disease in Women: Insights From the Nhlbi-Sponsored Women's Ischemia Syndrome Evaluation (Wise)" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1193162507>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2140745181>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3295328858>,
