<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3765213123> rdfs:label "Abnormal Resting Brain Activity in Patients With Functional Dyspepsia Is Related To Symptom Severity" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1206138037>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1841115806>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n189444910>,
