<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5774646968> rdfs:label "Interleukin-6 Modulates Graft-Versus-Host Responses After Experimental Allogeneic Bone Marrow Transplantation" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2100972017>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2550248050>,
