<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5934658664> rdfs:label "Reduction in Platelet Reactivity With Prasugrel 5 Mg in Low-Body-Weight Patients Is Noninferior To Prasugrel 10 Mg in Higher-Body-Weight Patients" ;
    ns6:abstract "The aim of this study was to confirm prior modeling data suggesting that prasugrel 5 mg in low-body-weight (LBW) patients would be noninferior to prasugrel 10 mg in higher-body-weight (HBW) patients as assessed by maximal platelet aggregation (MPA)." ;
