<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7302858229> rdfs:label "Pharmacodynamic Evaluation of Pantoprazole Therapy On Clopidogrel Effects Results of a Prospective, Randomized, Crossover Study" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1041636522>,
