        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7933803268>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8563115621>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n940012718> ;
    ns4:title "Pharmacodynamic Evaluation of Pantoprazole Therapy On Clopidogrel Effects Results of a Prospective, Randomized, Crossover Study" ;
    ns6:abstract "Safety concerns have recently emerged based on a drug interaction between clopidogrel and proton pump inhibitors leading to reduced pharmacodynamic effects. However, whether such drug interaction is a class effect or a drug effect and if this can be modulated by timing of drug administration remains a matter of debate. The aim of this study was to assess the impact of high-dose pantoprazole therapy, a proton pump inhibitor with low potential to interfere with clopidogrel metabolism, administered concomitantly or staggered, on clopidogrel-mediated pharmacodynamic effects." ;
    ns6:pageStart "273" ;
    ns6:volume "4" ;
    ns3:harvestedBy "Python Pubs version 1.1" ;
