<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n879091596> rdfs:label "Pre-B Cell Leukemia Homeobox 1 Is Associated With Lupus Susceptibility in Mice and Humans" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n102880>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1053499254>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1090399844>,
