<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n931974238> rdfs:label "Identification of low responders to a 300-mg clopidogrel loading dose in patients undergoing coronary stenting." ;
    ns6:abstract "Although patients undergoing coronary stenting routinely receive dual antiplatelet treatment to reduce the risk of stent thrombosis, this undesired event still occurs. A suboptimal response to clopidogrel treatment (low responders) has been suggested to contribute to stent thrombosis. In the present study, platelet function profiles were assessed in patients undergoing coronary stenting receiving a standard 300-mg clopidogrel loading dose with the aim to identify low clopidogrel responders." ;
    ns6:number "1-2" ;
    ns6:volume "115" ;
