<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9900965642> rdfs:label "Risk Factors for Atrial Fibrillation and Their Population Burden in Postmenopausal Women: the Women's Health Initiative Observational Study" ;
    ns6:abstract "Atrial fibrillation (AF) is the most common arrhythmia in women. Large studies evaluating key AF risk factors in older women are lacking. We aimed to identify risk factors for AF in postmenopausal women and measure population burden of modifiable risk factors." ;
