<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2339987067> rdfs:label "Interobserver Variability in Grading Transbronchial Lung Biopsy Specimens After Lung Transplantation" ;
    ns6:abstract "Acute rejection remains a major source of morbidity after lung transplantation. Given the importance of this diagnosis, an international grading system was developed to standardize the diagnosis of acute lung-allograft rejection. The reliability of this grading system has not been adequately assessed by previous studies." ;
