<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2787898026> rdfs:label "Late-Life Depressed Mood and Weight Change Contribute To the Risk of Each Other" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1027915884>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n12269>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n284927115>,
