<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6747509819> rdfs:label "Comparison of Factors Associated With Carotid Intima-Media Thickness in the Multi-Ethnic Study of Atherosclerosis (Mesa) and the Heinz Nixdorf Recall Study (Hnr)" ;
    ns6:abstract "The measurement of carotid intima-media thickness (CIMT) is a valid method to quantify levels of atherosclerosis. The present study was conducted to compare the strengths of associations between CIMT and cardiovascular risk factors in two different populations." ;
