<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7709989945> rdfs:label "A Multi-Center Phase Ib Study of Oxaliplatin (Nsc\\#266046) in Combination With Fluorouracil and Leucovorin in Pediatric Patients With Advanced Solid Tumors" ;
