<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8965873966> rdfs:label "Relationships Between Cardiovascular Disease Risk Factors and Depressive Symptoms as Predictors of Cardiovascular Disease Events in Women" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1016469480>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1104117703>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2134013996>,
