<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n308037923> rdfs:label "Detection of Drug Resistance Mutations At Low Plasma Hiv-1 Rna Load in a European Multicentre Cohort Study" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1863788668>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3196263156>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4678235360>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n567420489>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5958477632>,
