<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3278894386> rdfs:label "Objectives and Design of the Hemodialysis Fistula Maturation Study" ;
    ns6:abstract "A large proportion of newly created arteriovenous fistulas cannot be used for dialysis because they fail to mature adequately to support the hemodialysis blood circuit. The Hemodialysis Fistula Maturation (HFM) Study was designed to elucidate clinical and biological factors associated with fistula maturation outcomes." ;
    ns6:number "1" ;
    ns6:pageStart "104" ;
    ns6:volume "63" ;
