<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6616991155> rdfs:label "Resilience of Alaska's Boreal Forest To Climatic Change" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1271089921>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1500088440>,
