<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7819622192> rdfs:label "Association of Ireb2 and Chrna3 Polymorphisms With Airflow Obstruction in Severe Alpha-1 Antitrypsin Deficiency" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1214212991>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n149432828>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1715999629>,
