<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9513136358> rdfs:label "Alternative Donor Transplantation After Reduced Intensity Conditioning: Results of Parallel Phase 2 Trials Using Partially Hla-Mismatched Related Bone Marrow Or Unrelated Double Umbilical Cord Blood Grafts" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1027365216>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1137179626>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n154087>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2137864488>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4055477482>,
