<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4746255239> rdfs:label "Genetic Variation At Cr1 Increases Risk of Cerebral Amyloid Angiopathy" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2194648672>,
