    ns4:title "Comparison of Sirolimus With Azathioprine in a Tacrolimus-Based Immunosuppressive Regimen in Lung Transplantation" ;
    ns6:abstract "Lung transplantation has evolved into a life-saving therapy for select patients with end-stage lung diseases. However, long-term survival remains limited because of chronic rejection. Sirolimus is beneficial in preventing cardiac rejection and may decrease rejection after lung transplantation." ;
