<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6135418884> rdfs:label "Treatment of Intracranial Aneurysms With the Enterprise Stent: a Multicenter Registry" ;
    ns6:abstract "The development of self-expanding stents dedicated to intracranial use has significantly widened the applicability of endovascular therapy to many intracranial aneurysms that would otherwise have been untreatable by endovascular techniques. Recent Food and Drug Administration approval of the Enterprise Vascular Reconstruction Device and Delivery System (Cordis) has added a new option for self-expanding stent-assisted intracranial aneurysm coiling." ;
