    ns4:title "Response-Guided Telaprevir Combination Treatment for Hepatitis C Virus Infection" ;
    ns6:abstract "Patients with chronic infection with hepatitis C virus (HCV) genotype 1 often need 48 weeks of peginterferon-ribavirin treatment for a sustained virologic response. We designed a noninferiority trial (noninferiority margin, -10.5%) to compare rates of sustained virologic response among patients receiving two treatment durations." ;
