<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6784538316> rdfs:label "Modest Increase in Peak Vo2 Is Related To Better Clinical Outcomes in Chronic Heart Failure Patients Results From Heart Failure and a Controlled Trial To Investigate Outcomes of Exercise Training" ;
