<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7677654119> rdfs:label "Effects of a Brief Multimedia Psychoeducational Intervention On the Attitudes and Interest of Patients With Cancer Regarding Clinical Trial Participation: a Multicenter Randomized Controlled Trial" ;
    ns6:abstract "The negative attitudes of patients with cancer regarding clinical trials are an important contributor to low participation rates. This study evaluated whether a brief psychoeducational intervention was effective in improving patients' attitudes as well as their knowledge, self-efficacy for decision making, receptivity to receiving more information, and general willingness to participate in clinical trials." ;
