<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n962584330> rdfs:label "Phase 2 Clinical Trial of a Recombinant Adeno-Associated Viral Vector Expressing Alpha(1)-Antitrypsin: Interim Results" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1032407996>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1564094251>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n21179>,
