<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9870217182> rdfs:label "Decreasing Incidence of Plasmodium Vivax in the Republic of Korea During 2010-2012" ;
    ns6:abstract "After the re-emergence of Plasmodium vivax in 1993, a total of 31,254 cases of vivax malaria were reported between 1993-2012 in the Republic of Korea (ROK). The purpose of this study was to review Korea Centers for Disease Control and Prevention records to investigate the transmission of malaria from 2010-2012." ;
