<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n991856942> rdfs:label "Increased Risk of Venous Thromboembolism With a Sirolimus-Based Immunosuppression Regimen in Lung Transplantation" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n210145022>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2151805621>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2405981034>,
