<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n193981023> rdfs:label "Comparative Genomics Reveals Diversity Among Xanthomonads Infecting Tomato and Pepper" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n14917>,
