<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2088963001> rdfs:label "Evaluation of Circumsporozoite Protein of Plasmodium Vivax To Estimate Its Prevalence in the Republic of Korea: An Observational Study of Incidence" ;
    ns6:abstract "Plasmodium vivax re-emerged in 1993. Although the number of infections has been steadily decreasing, it is likely to continue to affect public health until it is eradicated. The aim of this study is to measure anti-circumsporozoite protein (CSP) antibody and compare malaria prevalence. As to understand the prevalence, an epidemiology study has to be conducted in the Republic of Korea." ;
