    ns4:title "Female Reproductive Disorders: the Roles of Endocrine-Disrupting Compounds and Developmental Timing" ;
    ns6:abstract "To evaluate the possible role of endocrine-disrupting compounds (EDCs) on female reproductive disorders emphasizing developmental plasticity and the complexity of endocrine-dependent ontogeny of reproductive organs. Declining conception rates and the high incidence of female reproductive disruptions warrant evaluation of the impact of EDCs on female reproductive health." ;
