    ns4:title "Insulin-Like Growth Factor Binding Protein-3 Mediates Vascular Repair By Enhancing Nitric Oxide Generation" ;
    ns6:abstract "Insulin-like growth factor binding protein (IGFBP)-3 modulates vascular development by regulating endothelial progenitor cell (EPC) behavior, specifically stimulating EPC cell migration. This study was undertaken to investigate the mechanism of IGFBP-3 effects on EPC function and how IGFBP-3 mediates cytoprotection following vascular injury." ;
