    ns4:title "Non-Metastatic Unresected Paediatric Non-Rhabdomyosarcoma Soft Tissue Sarcomas: Results of a Pooled Analysis From United States and European Groups" ;
    ns6:abstract "Non-rhabdomyosarcoma soft tissue sarcomas (NRSTS) with initially unresected tumours represent a particular subset of patients with a poor outcome. Various international research groups pooled their data in a joint study in order to investigate prognostic variables and treatment modalities." ;
