<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3287133026> rdfs:label "Ubiquitin C-Terminal Hydrolase Is a Novel Biomarker in Humans for Severe Traumatic Brain Injury" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n12340>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n14589>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n16746>,
