<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n58795628> rdfs:label "Delphi Consensus On the Feasibility of Translating the Acep Clinical Policies Into Computerized Clinical Decision Support" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1954884800>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2030709584>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3233338237>,
