<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5908858184> rdfs:label "Repeat Subtraction-Mediated Sequence Capture From a Complex Genome" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1244648462>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3434173090>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3457066075>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3463808977>,
