    ns4:title "Longevity Can Buffer Plant and Animal Populations Against Changing Climatic Variability" ;
    ns6:abstract "Although general agreement exists on palliative surgery with intent of symptom palliation in advanced gastric cancer (AGC), the role of non-curative surgery for incurable, asymptomatic AGC is hotly debated. We aim to clarify the role of non-curative surgery in patients with incurable, asymptomatic AGC under the first-line chemotherapy." ;
