<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8356308486> rdfs:label "Maize Centromere Mapping: a Comparison of Physical and Genetic Strategies" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1633467521>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1674240056>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1924913473>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2278175440>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n23237>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3551163010>,
