<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n907666803> rdfs:label "Complete Genome Sequence of the N-2-Fixing Broad Host Range Endophyte Klebsiella Pneumoniae 342 and Virulence Predictions Verified in Mice" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1170590691>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n192638244>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2033190163>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2464499507>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n26530>,
