<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4948668375> rdfs:label "Report From the First Snake Genomics and Integrative Biology Meeting" ;
    ns6:abstract "This report summarizes the proceedings of the 1st Snake Genomics and Integrative Biology Meeting held in Vail, CO USA, 5-8 October 2011. The meeting had over twenty registered participants, and was conducted as a single session of presentations. Goals of the meeting included coordination of genomic data collection and fostering collaborative interactions among researchers using snakes as model systems." ;
