<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5796957811> rdfs:label "Boosting the Globalization of Plant Proteomics Through Inppo: Current Developments and Future Prospects" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2019504713>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2130706024>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3471299545>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n35010>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3562339382>,
