<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7501296602> rdfs:label "Treatment Outcomes of New Tuberculosis Patients Hospitalized in Kampala, Uganda: a Prospective Cohort Study" ;
    ns6:abstract "In most resource limited settings, new tuberculosis (TB) patients are usually treated as outpatients. We sought to investigate the reasons for hospitalisation and the predictors of poor treatment outcomes and mortality in a cohort of hospitalized new TB patients in Kampala, Uganda." ;
