<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7924750583> rdfs:label "Safety and Efficacy of Peripheral Nerve Stimulation of the Occipital Nerves for the Management of Chronic Migraine: Results From a Randomized, Multicenter, Double-Blinded, Controlled Study" ;
