    ns4:title "Platelet Inhibition With Cangrelor in Patients Undergoing Pci." ;
    ns6:abstract "Cangrelor, a nonthienopyridine adenosine triphosphate analogue, is an intravenous blocker of the adenosine diphosphate receptor P2Y(12). This agent might have a role in the treatment of patients who require rapid, predictable, and profound but reversible platelet inhibition." ;
