<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8889691032> rdfs:label "Tumor Immunotherapy Across Mhc Barriers Using Allogeneic T-Cell Precursors" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1060185189>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2150712809>,
