<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9192843902> rdfs:label "Inhibition of Neovascularization To Simultaneously Ameliorate Graft-Vs-Host Disease and Decrease Tumor Growth" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1531650945>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1587557817>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2975151436>,
