<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n323538034> rdfs:label "Functional Coupling Between the Extracellular Matrix and Nuclear Lamina By Wnt Signaling in Progeria" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3371452453>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3821656517>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4312552972>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4399744768>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4498666649>,
