<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5315289009> rdfs:label "Self-Directed Learning of Basic Musculoskeletal Ultrasound Among Rheumatologists in the United States" ;
    ns6:abstract "Because musculoskeletal ultrasound (MSUS) is highly user dependent, we aimed to establish whether non-mentored learning of MSUS is sufficient to achieve the same level of diagnostic accuracy and scanning reliability as has been achieved by rheumatologists recognized as international experts in MSUS." ;
