<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7001061522> rdfs:label "Marine Reserves: Size and Age Do Matter" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1033020920>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1051116696>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1211763248>,
