<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7698016560> rdfs:label "Long-Term Restoration of Cardiac Dystrophin Expression in Golden Retriever Muscular Dystrophy Following Raav6-Mediated Exon Skipping" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n16433>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2164427503>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2640853831>,
