    ns4:title "Murine Antithymocyte Globulin Therapy Alters Disease Progression in Nod Mice By a Time-Dependent Induction of Immunoregulation" ;
    ns6:abstract "Antilymphocyte serum can reverse overt type 1 diabetes in NOD mice; yet, the therapeutic parameters and immunological mechanisms underlying the ability for this agent to modulate autoimmune responses against beta-cells are unclear, forming the rationale for this investigation." ;
