<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9806999436> rdfs:label "Adeno-Associated Virus-Mediated Correction of a Canine Model of Glycogen Storage Disease Type Ia" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1008272203;http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n87280>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n119390>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n14560>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n14839>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n16822>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1975107961>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n22173>,
