<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2064781778> rdfs:label "Critical Care Management of Patients Following Aneurysmal Subarachnoid Hemorrhage: Recommendations From the Neurocritical Care Society'S Multidisciplinary Consensus Conference" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n10332>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1140922273>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1141248576>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1205578462>,
