<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3376142384> rdfs:label "Subgroup Analysis of Trials Is Rarely Easy (Satire): a Study Protocol for a Systematic Review To Characterize the Analysis, Reporting, and Claim of Subgroup Effects in Randomized Trials" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1249>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1996863162>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2197075765>,
