<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5445313501> rdfs:label "Comparable Outcomes in Nonsecretory and Secretory Multiple Myeloma After Autologous Stem Cell Transplantation" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1321129709>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2045815733>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2334493335>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2388652613>,
