<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9126974064> rdfs:label "Gene Expression Profiles Predictive of Outcome and Age in Infant Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia: a Children'S Oncology Group Study" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1029808823>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1595294516>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n226757186>,
