<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9621466693> rdfs:label "The Association of Shelter Veterinarians Veterinary Medical Care Guidelines for Spay-Neuter Programs" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n108917902>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1154983722>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1287007235>,
