<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5091786886> rdfs:label "Ancestry and Pharmacogenomics of Relapse in Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1208514383>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1245180826>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1270134281>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1382688824>,
