<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7899229136> rdfs:label "Transport Properties of Pancreatic Cancer Describe Gemcitabine Delivery and Response" ;
    ns6:abstract "The therapeutic resistance of pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma (PDAC) is partly ascribed to ineffective delivery of chemotherapy to cancer cells. We hypothesized that physical properties at vascular, extracellular, and cellular scales influence delivery of and response to gemcitabine-based therapy." ;
