<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5306848012> rdfs:label "Invasive Non-Aspergillus Mold Infections in Transplant Recipients, United States, 2001-2006" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n154087>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1814540634>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1910546420>,
