    ns4:title "Variant of Tyr and Autoimmunity Susceptibility Loci in Generalized Vitiligo." ;
    ns6:abstract "Generalized vitiligo is an autoimmune disease characterized by melanocyte loss, which results in patchy depigmentation of skin and hair, and is associated with an elevated risk of other autoimmune diseases." ;
