<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9867359849> rdfs:label "A Two-Locus Dna Sequence Database for Typing Plant and Human Pathogens Within the Fusarium Oxysporum Species Complex" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1929296124>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n20430>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2183845337>,
