    ns4:title "Mirna Expression Profiling Enables Risk Stratification in Archived and Fresh Neuroblastoma Tumor Samples" ;
    ns6:abstract "More accurate assessment of prognosis is important to further improve the choice of risk-related therapy in neuroblastoma (NB) patients. In this study, we aimed to establish and validate a prognostic miRNA signature for children with NB and tested it in both fresh frozen and archived formalin-fixed paraffin-embedded (FFPE) samples." ;
