    ns4:title "Population Pharmacokinetics of Meropenem in Plasma and Cerebrospinal Fluid of Infants With Suspected Or Complicated Intra-Abdominal Infections" ;
    ns6:abstract "Suspected or complicated intra-abdominal infections are common in young infants and lead to significant morbidity and mortality. Meropenem is a broad-spectrum antimicrobial agent with excellent activity against pathogens associated with intra-abdominal infections in this population. The purpose of this study was to determine the pharmacokinetics (PK) of meropenem in young infants as a basis for optimizing dosing and minimizing adverse events." ;
    ns6:pageStart "844" ;
    ns6:volume "30" ;
