<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n5605106876> rdfs:label "Mammalian Target of Rapamycin Regulates Murine and Human Cell Differentiation Through Stat3/P63/Jagged/Notch Cascade" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1215461496>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1268921942>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1329332885>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1331612824>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1681476409>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1929213376>,
