<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4434483710> rdfs:label "Berlin Heart Excor Pediatric Ventricular Assist Device for Bridge To Heart Transplantation in Us Children" ;
    ns6:abstract "Recent data suggest that the Berlin Heart EXCOR Pediatric ventricular assist device is superior to extracorporeal membrane oxygenation for bridge to heart transplantation. Published data are limited to 1 in 4 children who received the device as part of the US clinical trial. We analyzed outcomes for all US children who received the EXCOR to characterize device outcomes in an unselected cohort and to identify risk factors for mortality to facilitate patient selection." ;
