<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n9929864135> rdfs:label "Semi-Annual Oscillations in Saturn'S Low-Latitude Stratospheric Temperatures" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1381264155>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n151988066>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1547254548>,
