<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1665486730> rdfs:label "Pregnancy After Hematopoietic Cell Transplantation: a Report From the Late Effects Working Committee of the Center for International Blood and Marrow Transplant Research (Cibmtr)" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n154087>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n167605455>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1911484569>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n21582925>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2244854334>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2269902054>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2765788851>,
