<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n3266125963> rdfs:label "Allogeneic Hematopoietic Cell Transplantation for Fanconi Anemia in Patients With Pretransplantation Cytogenetic Abnormalities, Myelodysplastic Syndrome, Or Acute Leukemia" ;
