<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n7328005295> rdfs:label "Deletion of Ikzf1 and Prognosis in Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia." ;
    ns6:abstract "Despite best current therapy, up to 20% of pediatric patients with acute lymphoblastic leukemia (ALL) have a relapse. Recent genomewide analyses have identified a high frequency of DNA copy-number abnormalities in ALL, but the prognostic implications of these abnormalities have not been defined." ;
