<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4006175476> rdfs:label "Safety and Effectiveness of Meropenem in Infants With Suspected Or Complicated Intra-Abdominal Infections" ;
    ns6:abstract "Intra-abdominal infections are common in young infants and lead to significant morbidity and mortality. Meropenem is a broad-spectrum antimicrobial with excellent activity against pathogens associated with intra-abdominal infections. The purpose of this study was to determine the safety and effectiveness of meropenem in young infants with suspected or complicated intra-abdominal infections." ;
    ns6:pageStart "1495" ;
    ns6:volume "55" ;
