<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4182575675> rdfs:label "Defining Responses To Therapy and Study Outcomes in Clinical Trials of Invasive Fungal Diseases: Mycoses Study Group and European Organization for Research and Treatment of Cancer Consensus Criteria" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1529460759>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n154087>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1786574510>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2628631964>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2661710181>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2966036600>,
