    ns4:title "The Clinicopathologic Spectrum of Focal Cortical Dysplasias: a Consensus Classification Proposed By An Ad Hoc Task Force of the Ilae Diagnostic Methods Commission" ;
    ns6:abstract "  Focal cortical dysplasias (FCD) are localized regions of malformed cerebral cortex and are very frequently associated with epilepsy in both children and adults. A broad spectrum of histopathology has been included in the diagnosis of FCD. An ILAE task force proposes an international consensus classification system to better characterize specific clinicopathological FCD entities." ;
