<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n531610716> rdfs:label "Discovery and Characterization of Alamandine a Novel Component of the Renin-Angiotensin System" ;
    ns6:abstract "The renin-angiotensin system (RAS) is a key regulator of the cardiovascular system, electrolyte, and water balance. Here, we report identification and characterization of alamandine, a new heptapeptide generated by catalytic action of angiotensin-converting enzyme-2 angiotensin A or directly from angiotensin-(1-7)." ;
