<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n2982760638> rdfs:label "Integrative Genomics Identifies Lmo1 as a Neuroblastoma Oncogene" ;
    ns4:creator <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1416745699>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n1433856895>,
        <http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n158323170>,
