<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n8503393308> rdfs:label "Diarrhea in Young Children From Low-Income Countries Leads To Large-Scale Alterations in Intestinal Microbiota Composition" ;
    ns6:abstract "Diarrheal diseases continue to contribute significantly to morbidity and mortality in infants and young children in developing countries. There is an urgent need to better understand the contributions of novel, potentially uncultured, diarrheal pathogens to severe diarrheal disease, as well as distortions in normal gut microbiota composition that might facilitate severe disease." ;
    ns6:number "6" ;
    ns6:volume "15" ;
    ns3:grantCited "5R01HG004885",
        "5R01HG005220",
