<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n4176299852> rdfs:label "Stroke Genetics Network (Sign) Study Design and Rationale for a Genome-Wide Association Study of Ischemic Stroke Subtypes" ;
    ns6:abstract "Meta-analyses of extant genome-wide data illustrate the need to focus on subtypes of ischemic stroke for gene discovery. The National Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke SiGN (Stroke Genetics Network) contributes substantially to meta-analyses that focus on specific subtypes of stroke." ;
    ns6:pageStart "2694" ;
    ns6:volume "44" ;
