<http://vivo.ufl.edu/individual/n6373427989> rdfs:label "Sequencing Three Crocodilian Genomes To Illuminate the Evolution of Archosaurs and Amniotes" ;
    ns6:abstract "The International Crocodilian Genomes Working Group (ICGWG) will sequence and assemble the American alligator (Alligator mississippiensis), saltwater crocodile (Crocodylus porosus) and Indian gharial (Gavialis gangeticus) genomes. The status of these projects and our planned analyses are described." ;
