    ns1:teachingOverview "I am co-editor of the popular textbook \"A Plant Tissue Culture Concepts and Laboratory Exercises\", now in its second edition with the 3rd edition contracted for 2008. I am co-editor of the textbook &ldquo;Plant Development and Biotechnology&rdquo;, which appeared in 2005. It is the text for UF/IFAS course PLS 4242C - Micropropagation of Horticultural Crops and the texts collectively are used around the world. I routinely provide guest lectures." ;
